# Example environment file for Cloudflare deploys.
#
# This project uses `wrangler login` (OAuth) by default — no env file
# is required for local deploys. You can verify auth with:
#   npx wrangler whoami
#
# If you prefer API-token auth (e.g. for CI), copy this file to `.env`
# and fill in a token from:
#   https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
# Required scope: Account -> Cloudflare Pages -> Edit
#
# Note: the Cloudflare account must NOT have Token Geo-Restriction
# enabled, or the token will be rejected with code 9109.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
